  "sourceNotes": [
    "Manufacturer-origin Malaysia development booklet independently confirms N01, Aya, X, GT and L introductions; introductory dates are not automatically production-start dates for facelifts.",
    "N01 2018–2020 and original-family start years use individual model production-history pages.",
    "Thai V-II Lite/Smart and X Comfort/Smart technical specifications are kept separate from Chinese and Indonesian configurations."
  ],
  "gaps": [
    "S Hunting Edition wagon is documented as revealed in August 2024, but independent serial-production confirmation is still needed before adding a separate body-generation record.",
    "Primary per-model production stop/resumption dates remain unresolved amid company restructuring; null ends do not mean current production.",
    "U Pro/U-II variants and domestic Chinese battery/EREV configurations are not fully enumerated.",
    "Thai X range/cycle and all four versions’ precise model years/transmission details need further verified documentation.",
    "Commons category and exact-name file searches are bounded. U, L and N01 candidates were predominantly 4:3 (below the preferred 1.4 aspect); X candidate 1399x787 is above 1.7. These require a better-framed reference or an explicitly accepted aspect exception, not a claim that Commons has no images."
  ],
  "excluded": [
    "Eureka 01/02/03, U-Saloon and other concepts are not independent production cards.",
    "GT Speedster and unconfirmed concept/announcement derivatives excluded.",
    "Hozon corporate identity does not create duplicate model cards."
  ],
